\title{A graph as a word}
\taxon{Example}
\date{2026-01-15}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{Let #{\Gamma} be the graph with adjacency matrix}

##{G = \begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \end{pmatrix},}

\p{written as the word #{0010\,0010\,1101\,0010}. If #{\Pi = \lbrace G : G \text{ is a graph which is a tree}\rbrace } then #{0010001011010010 \in \Pi}.}
